<div n="2" type="jArticle" xml:id="brief1" next="#brief2">                <head>                   <hi rendition="#b">(Ein Brief Stöcker&#x2019;s.)</hi>                </head>                 <p>Der &#x201E;Vorwärts&#x201C;<lb/>
